00:00:35.130 --> 00:00:36.070
I don't like attention either,

00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:37.866
so you're gonna do it to my song.

00:00:37.866 --> 00:00:40.089
(all laughing)

00:00:40.089 --> 00:00:42.726
